" Spec [Tablature][[Editing]] 2 (`_`, songwriter#tab#AddDash): insert a dash
" after the cursor column on every string of the tab block.

Given (_ inserts a dash at the cursor column on every tab string):
  e|----|
  B|----|
  G|----|
  D|----|
  A|----|
  E|----|

Execute (_ inserts a dash at the cursor column on every tab string):
  call cursor(1, 4)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDash()
Expect:
  e|-----|
  B|-----|
  G|-----|
  D|-----|
  A|-----|
  E|-----|

Given (dash is inserted at the cursor column, before a later note):
  e|----4--|
  B|----4--|
  G|----4--|

Execute (dash is inserted at the cursor column, before a later note):
  call cursor(1, 6)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDash()
Expect:
  e|-----4--|
  B|-----4--|
  G|-----4--|

Given (works when cursor is on any string line):
  e|----|
  B|----|
  G|----|

Execute (works when cursor is on any string line):
  call cursor(3, 4)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDash()
Expect:
  e|-----|
  B|-----|
  G|-----|

Given (does not affect non-tab lines):
  some prose line
  another line

Execute (does not affect non-tab lines):
  call cursor(1, 1)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDash()
Expect:
  some prose line
  another line
